<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Miner dies in Sasol colliery accident.</title>
<headline>Miner dies in Sasol colliery accident.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>One miner was killed after a roof collapsed underground at Sasol Mining's Bosjesspruit Colliery near Secunda, Sasol Ltd said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>The company said the accident occurred on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The cause of the collapse was not yet known and a full investigation was being conducted, the company said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
